        <mxCell id="note1" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;size=14;" value="&lt;b&gt;Draft decisions (agree with the team)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Level is NOT stored in GameState; it selects the strategy through StrategyRegistry / GameConfig.&lt;br&gt;• An enemy may not enter a cell occupied by another enemy; it stays in place.&lt;br&gt;• Hero.justTeleported blocks re-triggering the partner loophole on arrival.&lt;br&gt;• Clock is injected so elapsed time is testable.&lt;br&gt;• move() returns TurnResult(state, events) so the API can send the turn&#39;s events; illegal moves throw IllegalMoveException (400), moves after the end throw GameFinishedException (409)." vertex="1">
